    "explanations": {
      "GSE3578_array": "29614 of 54359 features (54.5%) resolved to no canonical gene. 28807 of those probe ids are present in the platform table but its annotation row carries neither a gene symbol nor a gene id, so the ceiling is set by the annotation itself: it assigns a gene identifier to only 25552 of 54359 probe ids (47.0%). ",
      "MGH_GSE115821_bulk": "54228 of 75253 features (72.1%) resolved to no canonical gene. 54071 unmapped tokens match the NONHSAG_legacy_noncoding_id pattern. 73 unmapped tokens match the LOC_retired_locuslink_id pattern. 28 unmapped tokens match the excel_date_corrupted_symbol pattern. Excluding those tokens the remaining features map at 99.2%.",
      "MGH_GSE168204_bulk": "54201 of 75253 features (72.0%) resolved to no canonical gene. 54071 unmapped tokens match the NONHSAG_legacy_noncoding_id pattern. 73 unmapped tokens match the LOC_retired_locuslink_id pattern. Excluding those tokens the remaining features map at 99.4%."
    },
    "mgh_note": "MGH contributes two independent expression files; they are mapped as two sources so a legacy annotation cannot hide the contemporary one"
  },
